# Y-Combinator Co-Founder Tool

A RAG-powered tool for startup co-founders that grounds responses in Y Combinator
knowledge and company data. It supports idea validation, startup planning, and
workflow automation through a Streamlit app, with retrieval powered by ChromaDB
and sentence-transformers on top of Kimi K2.
